# GitLab-only remotes

- **Source of truth / CI / deploy**: GitLab only (`gitlab` / `gitlab-cc` for FE; `gitlab-cn` / `gitlab-cc` for BE).
- **Not in scope for shipping**: GitHub (`origin`), Vercel, or any “push to GitHub so Vercel deploys” flow.
- When reporting status after a ship, mention GitLab remotes only — do not claim GitHub or Vercel updates unless the user explicitly asks about those remotes.
